 Build reusable, type-safe functions and interfaces using Generic Type Placeholders (&lt;T&gt;).
 </p>

 <!-- Concept Slot (Left Pane) -->
 <div slot="concept" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
 
